{title: He Has Made Me Glad}
{key: D}

{comment: Verse}
[D]I will enter His [G]gates with thanks-[D]giv-ing in my heart,
I will enter His [G]courts with [A]praise.
I will [D]say this is the [G]day that the [D]Lord [Gb]has   [Bm]made,
I [G]will rejoice for [A]He has made me [D]glad.

{comment: Chorus}
He has made me [G]glad, [D]He has made me [Bm]glad,
I [Em]will rejoice for [A]He has made me [D]gla  - [Em]a -  a[D]d.
[Gbm]He has made me [G]glad, [Gbm]He had made me [Bm]glad,
I [Em]will rejoice for [A]He has made me [D]glad.
